["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/blake2b384", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "BLAKE2b algorithm with a digest size of 384, as defined in [RFC 7693](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc7693/) Section 4.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
